{"qid": "76574260", "kind": "freshstack", "language": "js", "title": "Using NextJS 13 with Langchain's recommended vectorstore giving Error: HNSWLib is not installed", "answer": "The error is due to the fact that HNSWLib is not installed as a dependency in the project. The error message suggests installing HNSWLib as a dependency with `npm install -S hnswlib-node`. This can be achieved by adding `hnswlib-node` to the `dependencies` section in `package.json`.", "valid_output": true, "insufficient_information": false, "retrieved": ["langchainjs/examples/src/chains/retrieval_qa_legacy.ts_0_1279", "langchainjs/docs/core_docs/docs/integrations/vectorstores/hnswlib.ipynb_0_6756", "langchainjs/examples/src/chains/retrieval_qa_custom_prompt_legacy.ts_0_1521"], "cited_doc_ids": ["langchainjs/examples/src/chains/retrieval_qa_legacy.ts_0_1279", "langchainjs/docs/core_docs/docs/integrations/vectorstores/hnswlib.ipynb_0_6756"], "invalid_citations": [], "repaired_citations": [], "degenerate_answer": false, "context_coverage": 0.3333333333333333, "context_recall": 0.25, "nuggets": ["The error is related to the import of the hnswlib-node package in a NextJS environment.", "The solution involves modifying the next.config.js file to resolve the import issue.", "The webpack configuration in next.config.js needs to include 'hnswlib-node' as an external dependency by adding the line: `config.externals = [...config.externals, 'hnswlib-node'];`."], "nuggets_present": null, "nugget_judge_ok": null, "citations": [{"doc_id": "langchainjs/examples/src/chains/retrieval_qa_legacy.ts_0_1279", "supported": null, "judge_supported": null, "quote": null, "quote_found": null, "judge_ok": null, "relevant_in_qrels": false, "judged_in_qrels": false}, {"doc_id": "langchainjs/docs/core_docs/docs/integrations/vectorstores/hnswlib.ipynb_0_6756", "supported": null, "judge_supported": null, "quote": null, "quote_found": null, "judge_ok": null, "relevant_in_qrels": true, "judged_in_qrels": true}], "generation_