{"qid": "77164318", "kind": "freshstack", "language": "python", "title": "Error with LangChain ChatPromptTemplate.from_messages", "answer": "The error occurs because the `messages` parameter in `ChatPromptTemplate.from_messages()` expects a dictionary where each key is a message type and each value is a dictionary containing the message content. However, in the provided code, the `messages` parameter is a list of tuples, where each tuple contains a message type and a string. To fix this, you need to create a dictionary where each key is a message type and each value is a dictionary containing the message content. For example:\n", "valid_output": true, "insufficient_information": false, "retrieved": ["langchain/docs/docs/integrations/chat/jinachat.ipynb_0_4137", "langchain/libs/core/langchain_core/prompts/chat.py_36265_46559", "langchain/libs/core/langchain_core/prompts/chat.py_27425_36259"], "cited_doc_ids": ["langchain/docs/docs/integrations/chat/jinachat.ipynb_0_4137", "langchain/libs/core/langchain_core/prompts/chat.py_36265_46559", "langchain/libs/core/langchain_core/prompts/chat.py_27425_36259"], "invalid_citations": [], "repaired_citations": [], "degenerate_answer": false, "context_coverage": 0.3333333333333333, "context_recall": 0.1875, "nuggets": ["The code example provided should work as it is based on the LangChain Quickstart tutorial.", "The error might be due to an outdated version of LangChain or its dependencies.", "It is recommended to try running the code in a new virtual environment with a fresh install of LangChain."], "nuggets_present": null, "nugget_judge_ok": null, "citations": [{"doc_id": "langchain/docs/docs/integrations/chat/jinachat.ipynb_0_4137", "supported": null, "judge_supported": null, "quote": null, "quote_found": null, "judge_ok": null, "relevant_in_qrels": true, "judged_in_qrels": true}, {"doc_id": "langchain/libs/core/langchain_core/prompts/chat.py_36265_46559", "supported": null, "judge_supported": null, "quote": null, "quote_found