{"qid": "77921898", "kind": "freshstack", "language": "python", "title": "Not getting source documents from chain in langchain and openAI embeddings", "answer": "The `Chroma` vector store integration does not provide source documents by default. You need to specify the `collection_name` and `embedding_function` when instantiating the `Chroma` class. Also, you need to add source documents to the vector store using the `add_doc` method. You can modify the code to include the following lines to add source documents to the vector store: `vector_store.add_doc(doc_1, doc_2, doc_3)`", "valid_output": true, "insufficient_information": false, "retrieved": ["langchain/libs/community/tests/integration_tests/chains/test_retrieval_qa_with_sources.py_0_1711", "langchain/libs/partners/chroma/langchain_chroma/vectorstores.py_4107_13535", "langchain/docs/docs/integrations/document_loaders/psychic.ipynb_0_4273"], "cited_doc_ids": ["langchain/libs/partners/chroma/langchain_chroma/vectorstores.py_4107_13535"], "invalid_citations": [], "repaired_citations": [], "degenerate_answer": false, "context_coverage": 0.0, "context_recall": 0.0, "nuggets": ["The `persist_directory` must be specified as a keyword argument in the `Chroma` instantiation to retrieve source documents.", "Correct instantiation of `Chroma`: `docsearch = Chroma(persist_directory=persist_directory, embedding_function=embeddings)`."], "nuggets_present": null, "nugget_judge_ok": null, "citations": [{"doc_id": "langchain/libs/partners/chroma/langchain_chroma/vectorstores.py_4107_13535", "supported": null, "judge_supported": null, "quote": null, "quote_found": null, "judge_ok": null, "relevant_in_qrels": false, "judged_in_qrels": true}], "generation_s": 24.584768100001384, "judge_s": null, "prompt_tokens": 1573, "output_tokens": 137, "config": {"tokenizer": "word_stem", "query_mode": "full", "top_k": 3, "max_chars": 1500, "max_tokens": 800, "prompt": "c745ef277954", "answer_rules": 4, "assistant_llm": {"model": "llama3.2:3b",